3
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:27,643
In accordance with the 2020 executive order, this meeting of the city of Medford zoning board of appeals is being conducted totally via remote participation using Zoom, including committee members and the public.

4
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:38,067
